   "gap_before": 1.21,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "studying.dlg16"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Ha, he'll love that. What about the sevens?",
   "est_sec": 2.58,
   "gap_before": 2.34,
   "block": "studying.dlg16",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "For those, practise in short bursts while doing something else, like counting stairs in sevens or clapping a rhythm.",
   "est_sec": 5.99,
   "gap_before": 0.65,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "studying.dlg16"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "I was taught by",
   "est_sec": 1.34,
